{"4406760": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Fernhoof Grove: Riding Academy", "steam_appid": 4406760, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4406760/extras/b4845bc24028b569a45a2b64d99143af.webp?t=1782999829\" width=352 height=36 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">    <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4406760/extras/c0646596a38ec8f1cc47cfb97c085090.poster.avif?t=1782999829\" width=700 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4406760/extras/c0646596a38ec8f1cc47cfb97c085090.webm?t=1782999829\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4406760/extras/c0646596a38ec8f1cc47cfb97c085090.mp4?t=1782999829\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have been chosen to study at the Fernhoof Academy, known for their jumping focused trainer program. <strong>Ride lessons</strong> to expand your knowledge and <strong>put your skills to the test in  riding exams</strong>. Read up on <strong>equine theory</strong> to earn an A+ on your tests. Gain practical experience by <strong>training horses to improve their skills</strong>. If you wish to reach graduation, follow the designed degree and prove your expertise to the instructors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4406760/extras/103c3e6c08aabafbba30a919231dab7c.webp?t=1782999829\" width=232 height=36 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">    <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4406760/extras/e7e1891ae5ec28b40deac050c4b42937.poster.avif?t=1782999829\" width=700 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4406760/extras/e7e1891ae5ec28b40deac050c4b42937.webm?t=1782999829\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4406760/extras/e7e1891ae5ec28b40deac050c4b42937.mp4?t=1782999829\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Own horses</strong> and look after them at the academy stables. Prepare  for training with <strong>satisfying horse care brushing and filling feed buckets</strong>. Adjust to your taste by taking on extra care jobs or outsourcing all of it to stable hands. Watch your equine friends show their appreciation for getting pampered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4406760/extras/0beca3049ee1b0dc0b98eaf29f4da6cd.webp?t=1782999829\" width=391 height=36 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">    <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4406760/extras/190fa4db4eb5cf1e767585c95ab2bc90.poster.avif?t=1782999829\" width=700 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4406760/extras/190fa4db4eb5cf1e767585c95ab2bc90.webm?t=1782999829\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4406760/extras/190fa4db4eb5cf1e767585c95ab2bc90.mp4?t=1782999829\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump a course in the arena, gallop in the cross country fields or go for a relaxed bareback trail ride. The in-depth <strong>riding mechanics draw inspiration from real riding</strong>, including canter leads, realistic striding on jumps and preserving the horse's energy on a course. <strong>Tailor how you ride each horse</strong> based on their temperament and skills. Choose your preference to <strong>ride in third or first person</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4406760/extras/92beba042dbe76fe8861f06211e71577.webp?t=1782999829\" width=295 height=36 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">    <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4406760/extras/039caa719ef69d28b5f5c022e50b8f18.poster.avif?t=1782999829\" width=700 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4406760/extras/039caa719ef69d28b5f5c022e50b8f18.webm?t=1782999829\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4406760/extras/039caa719ef69d28b5f5c022e50b8f18.mp4?t=1782999829\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Riding the training exercises with <strong>accuracy and good timing</strong> greatly affects how the horse learns from them. Getting the most out of a training session is not about repetition, but <strong>sharpening your own skills and directing the horse's limited focus on good execution</strong>. Help your own and client horses reach their full potential, and <strong>prove yourself in show jumping and cross country competitions</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4406760/extras/02b9e11f9f3774680c71a555c488e95b.webp?t=1782999829\" width=350 height=36 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">    <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4406760/extras/a42a727c9d8e3feeae56a5e4262c3e51.poster.avif?t=1782999829\" width=700 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4406760/extras/a42a727c9d8e3feeae56a5e4262c3e51.webm?t=1782999829\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4406760/extras/a42a727c9d8e3feeae56a5e4262c3e51.mp4?t=1782999829\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Design  training routines</strong> using the handy builder. Place riding patterns such as voltes and serpentines to practice agility and strength, or focus on jumping with a custom show jumping course. <strong>Collaborate with the community</strong> by sharing routines using easy text input.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4406760/extras/9daf783da673a40f43a6694d7bf0d10b.webp?t=1782999829\" width=270 height=36 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">    <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4406760/extras/2e2d8ccf72675b736a14f913db635fb2.poster.avif?t=1782999829\" width=700 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4406760/extras/2e2d8ccf72675b736a14f913db635fb2.webm?t=1782999829\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4406760/extras/2e2d8ccf72675b736a14f913db635fb2.mp4?t=1782999829\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shop for new horses or sell yours</strong> at the Hightrail Horse Market. Keep an eye on their <strong>daily changing themes</strong> and choose the next member of the herd from a <strong>wide variety of looks and backgrounds</strong>. Go for a quick <strong>test ride</strong> at the market's arena before making a decision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4406760/extras/255419db1a635f13866cefc9ab541b41.webp?t=1782999829\" width=393 height=36 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">    <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4406760/extras/f0ec6c4294783821b940fb4acb832ba9.poster.avif?t=1782999829\" width=700 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4406760/extras/f0ec6c4294783821b940fb4acb832ba9.webm?t=1782999829\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4406760/extras/f0ec6c4294783821b940fb4acb832ba9.mp4?t=1782999829\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visit the academy's own Tiny Tack Shop to <strong>purchase new items</strong> to your collection. Give each of your horses a unique look in the tack room by <strong>customizing their tack set</strong> and <strong>styling their mane, tail and forelock</strong> separately.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4406760/extras/b4845bc24028b569a45a2b64d99143af.webp?t=1782999829\" width=352 height=36 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">    <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4406760/extras/c0646596a38ec8f1cc47cfb97c085090.poster.avif?t=1782999829\" width=700 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4406760/extras/c0646596a38ec8f1cc47cfb97c085090.webm?t=1782999829\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4406760/extras/c0646596a38ec8f1cc47cfb97c085090.mp4?t=1782999829\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have been chosen to study at the Fernhoof Academy, known for their jumping focused trainer program. <strong>Ride lessons</strong> to expand your knowledge and <strong>put your skills to the test in  riding exams</strong>. Read up on <strong>equine theory</strong> to earn an A+ on your tests. Gain practical experience by <strong>training horses to improve their skills</strong>. If you wish to reach graduation, follow the designed degree and prove your expertise to the instructors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4406760/extras/103c3e6c08aabafbba30a919231dab7c.webp?t=1782999829\" width=232 height=